DSHMap.receive("pkg","@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-badge-skill-bundle",{"readme":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-badge-skill-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nLet Agents whose presets load skills add a “powered by dsh” badge to documents, pull requests, and other outputs. The shared provider adds no model tool. It ships switched off in Web and Desktop. Select it in Plugins to enable it.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Further Exploration](#further-exploration)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nIn Web or Desktop, open Plugins and enable **DSH badge skill** in Official. Switch it off to remove its profile layer.\n\nThe switch adds or removes a Host-wide skill provider for existing and new Agents. Presets that expose skill loading can use the badge; minimal keeps its tool catalog unchanged.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Implementation details — click to expand</summary>\n\n[`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) contributes the `skill-badge` provider row on the Host. Later root patches can disable that row; an override alone does not select the bundle. The [profile composer](../../boot/app-boot/README.md) owns patch ordering and errors.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"further-exploration\"></a>\n## Further Exploration\n\n[Capability implementation](../skill-badge/README.md)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the [capability implementation](../skill-badge/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- A preset must include skill discovery and loading to use the badge. The minimal preset does not gain skill tools from this bundle.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer context — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","modelExperience":"Indirectly, through the [capability implementation](../skill-badge/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.","limitations":"- A preset must include skill discovery and loading to use the badge. The minimal preset does not gain skill tools from this bundle.\n\n-----","files":[["README.i18n.yaml",37,1583,"o"],["README.md",78,2384,"o"],["README.zh.md",78,2169,"o"],["cordis.patch.yml",3,75,"o"],["icon.svg",6,647,"o"],["locale/en.json",6,165,"o"],["locale/zh.json",6,144,"o"],["package.json",49,1231,"o"],["src/index.ts",2,98,"s"],["tsconfig.json",15,227,"o"]],"sources":{"README.md":"---\ndescription: \"Let agents add a “powered by dsh” badge to documents, pull requests, and other outputs.\"\nkind: \"package-bundle\"\n---\n\n# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-badge-skill-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nLet Agents whose presets load skills add a “powered by dsh” badge to documents, pull requests, and other outputs. The shared provider adds no model tool. It ships switched off in Web and Desktop. Select it in Plugins to enable it.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Further Exploration](#further-exploration)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nIn Web or Desktop, open Plugins and enable **DSH badge skill** in Official. Switch it off to remove its profile layer.\n\nThe switch adds or removes a Host-wide skill provider for existing and new Agents. Presets that expose skill loading can use the badge; minimal keeps its tool catalog unchanged.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Implementation details — click to expand</summary>\n\n[`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) contributes the `skill-badge` provider row on the Host. Later root patches can disable that row; an override alone does not select the bundle. The [profile composer](../../boot/app-boot/README.md) owns patch ordering and errors.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"further-exploration\"></a>\n## Further Exploration\n\n[Capability implementation](../skill-badge/README.md)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the [capability implementation](../skill-badge/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- A preset must include skill discovery and loading to use the badge. The minimal preset does not gain skill tools from this bundle.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer context — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","cordis.patch.yml":"- insert:\n    - id: skill-badge\n      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-badge'\n","icon.svg":"<svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"6\" y=\"11.5\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#4D6BFE\" />\n  <path d=\"M10 15V21H11.5C13.2 21 14 20 14 18C14 16 13.2 15 11.5 15H10Z\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n  <path d=\"M19.9 15.4C19.2 15 18.7 15 18 15C16.7 15 16 15.6 16 16.5C16 17.5 16.9 17.8 18 18C19.2 18.2 20 18.6 20 19.5C20 20.4 19.2 21 18 21C17.2 21 16.5 20.8 16 20.4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n  <path d=\"M22 15V21M26 15V21M22 18H26\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" />\n</svg>\n","locale/en.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"DSH badge skill\",\n    \"description\": \"Let agents add a “powered by dsh” badge to documents, pull requests, and other outputs.\"\n  }\n}\n","locale/zh.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"DSH 徽章技能\",\n    \"description\": \"让 Agent 为文档、PR 等产出添加「powered by dsh」徽章。\"\n  }\n}\n","package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-badge-skill-bundle\",\n  \"description\": \"Let agents add a “powered by dsh” badge to documents, pull requests, and other outputs.\",\n  \"version\": \"0.2.1-rc.2\",\n  \"icon\": \"./icon.svg\",\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"access\": \"public\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git\",\n    \"directory\": \"packages/experimental/badge-skill-bundle\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./lib/index.js\"\n    },\n    \"./cordis.patch.yml\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"./locale/*.json\": \"./locale/*.json\",\n    \"./src/*\": \"./src/*\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"icon.svg\",\n    \"locale/*.json\",\n    \"lib/index.js\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"lib/types/**/*.d.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-badge\": \"workspace:*\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  }\n}\n","src/index.ts":"/** DSH badge skill profile layer; runtime entries are declared in cordis.patch.yml. */\nexport {}\n","tsconfig.json":"{\n  \"extends\": \"../../../tsconfig.base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\",\n    \"outDir\": \"lib/types\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\n    \"src\"\n  ],\n  \"references\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"../../../vendor/cordis\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"symbols":{"defs":[],"files":{},"api":[],"uses":{}}});
